@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+# Archived pre-baseline migrations (0000–0077)
+
+Superseded by the squashed baseline in `src/db/migrations/` (R-DB-02,
+2026-09-25). Kept for history only. drizzle-kit's `out` config
+(`drizzle.config.ts`) doesn't point here, so `db:generate`, `db:migrate`,
+`db:push` and `drizzle-kit check` never read this directory.
+
+Known problems in this history. None were fixed, because a file nothing
+executes again can't matter:
+
+- `0015_sturdy_phantom_reporter.sql` (the `legal_documents` composite PK) was
+  never in `meta/_journal.json` and never ran anywhere. It has been deleted.
+  Its effect was already in every snapshot from `0016` on, and it's in the
+  baseline.
+- `0017_add_dispute_reference_number.sql`'s journal `when` is earlier than
+  `0016`'s, so drizzle-kit's migrator always skipped it.
+  `0018_young_amphibian.sql` (a plain `serial` column) is what actually ran
+  everywhere, and the baseline reproduces it.
+- Nothing here creates the base tables (`user`, `listings`, `rentals`, …).
+  They came from the environments' original bootstrap, which is why this
+  history couldn't rebuild an empty database.
+- The `reviews` and `service_reviews` tables were removed from the schema and
+  snapshots in #147 (`cd6aeb2`, replaced by `blind_reviews`) with no `DROP`
+  migration. They still exist on dev and staging; the baseline doesn't create
+  them.
+- PostGIS was installed on Neon by hand, not by a migration. The baseline's
+  `0001` creates it.
